WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.079 --> 00:00:07.216
Glen started rocking the canoe back and forth. "Everyone ready?"

2
00:00:07.217 --> 00:00:09.989
Splash!

3
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:14.837
"This water is fr-freezing!" Ivy shouted.

4
00:00:14.838 --> 00:00:19.942
"Ack! The paddles are floating away!" Ezra said.

5
00:00:19.943 --> 00:00:23.177
The kids swam to the capsized canoe.

6
00:00:23.178 --> 00:00:27.341
They tried climbing on it, but it was very slippery.

7
00:00:27.342 --> 00:00:31.846
"We're failing this test," Ivy said.

8
00:00:31.847 --> 00:00:35.322
The Blue team swiftly paddled their canoe over.

9
00:00:35.323 --> 00:00:39.485
Inside were Annie, Wes Wheezer, and Richard.

10
00:00:39.486 --> 00:00:46.191
"Swim under the canoe." Annie sneezed a few times.

11
00:00:46.192 --> 00:00:49.612
"Then lift it up and flip it over."

12
00:00:49.613 --> 00:00:56.165
The Yellow team managed to follow her instructions.

13
00:00:56.166 --> 00:00:59.289
"Good job!" Richard said.

14
00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:03.519
Next, Annie told them how to get back in.

15
00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:08.333
They all climbed in, but the canoe was half-filled with water.

16
00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:12.087
"We're sinking!" Ezra cried.

17
00:01:12.088 --> 00:01:16.155
"And where are our paddles?" Ivy asked.

18
00:01:16.156 --> 00:01:20.284
The Blue team grabbed the floating paddles and handed them over.

19
00:01:20.285 --> 00:01:25.443
Annie kept sneezing. "Ah-choo! Ah-choo!"

20
00:01:25.444 --> 00:01:28.151
"Bless you!" Glen said.

21
00:01:28.152 --> 00:01:33.506
"Um . . . " Ivy looked nervously at the water in the bottom of the canoe.

22
00:01:33.507 --> 00:01:36.439
"We'd better paddle fast!"

23
00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.060
The Yellow team paddled hard.

24
00:01:39.061 --> 00:01:42.792
But soon their canoe was almost completely under water.

25
00:01:42.793 --> 00:01:45.638
"Hop out!" Penelope called from the shore.

26
00:01:45.639 --> 00:01:48.316
"Pull your canoe in by the rope!"

27
00:01:48.317 --> 00:01:50.245
The kids hopped out.

28
00:01:50.246 --> 00:01:54.399
Glen grabbed the rope tied to the front and pulled the canoe ashore.

29
00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:58.376
Ezra and Ivy walked out of the water.

30
00:01:58.377 --> 00:02:02.065
"At least you made it back safely," Penelope said.

31
00:02:02.066 --> 00:02:08.358
"But you were right. You guys need practice—lots and lots of practice!"

32
00:02:08.359 --> 00:02:14.414
"Even cheerful Penelope thinks we're a disaster," Ivy thought.

33
00:02:14.415 --> 00:02:17.913
Ivy, Glen, and Ezra were soaking wet.

34
00:02:17.914 --> 00:02:27.014
They walked back to their cabins to change into dry clothes.

35
00:02:27.015 --> 00:02:29.319
Ivy shook her head.

36
00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:35.199
"There's no way we'll win this race. The Blue team is super fast."

37
00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:38.279
"We have to win," Glen said. "I

38
00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:41.512
can taste that Colossal Cone now. Four

39
00:02:41.513 --> 00:02:45.472
scoops and six toppings will be mine!" "Come

40
00:02:45.473 --> 00:02:48.191
on, Ivy," Ezra said. "We

41
00:02:48.192 --> 00:02:53.833
need to try. It's not just a trip to Frosty Freeze." "What

42
00:02:53.834 --> 00:02:56.656
do you mean?" she asked. "The

43
00:02:56.657 --> 00:03:01.830
losers stay behind to play soccer," Ezra said. "Do

44
00:03:01.831 --> 00:03:06.131
you want to eat ice cream or play soccer?" Ivy

45
00:03:06.132 --> 00:03:08.800
hated soccer. There

46
00:03:08.801 --> 00:03:11.974
was too much running in the hot sun. And

47
00:03:11.975 --> 00:03:16.249
she always got hit on the head with the ball. Ivy

48
00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:22.267
nodded. "Okay, I'll try my hardest." ***

49
00:03:22.268 --> 00:03:26.324
The next morning the Yellow team was back at the lake in a canoe.

50
00:03:26.325 --> 00:03:31.338
From her own canoe, Penelope was teaching them different paddle strokes.

51
00:03:31.339 --> 00:03:34.904
"First, we'll do a J stroke," Penelope said.

52
00:03:34.905 --> 00:03:38.237
"Draw the letter J in the water."

53
00:03:38.238 --> 00:03:41.238
The kids copied Penelope's stroke.

54
00:03:41.239 --> 00:03:45.576
Just then Richard and Wes Wheezer paddled past them.

55
00:03:45.577 --> 00:03:49.753
"Hey, guys, where's Annie?" Ezra called.

56
00:03:49.754 --> 00:03:54.911
"She's sick," Richard said. "She's in the infirmary."

57
00:03:54.912 --> 00:03:58.813
"Did you hear that?" Glen grinned at his teammates.

58
00:03:58.814 --> 00:04:02.478
"If Annie's sick, maybe we can beat Blue!"

59
00:04:02.479 --> 00:04:08.344
"The infirmary?" Ivy said. "What do kids do in the infirmary?"

60
00:04:08.345 --> 00:04:14.565
"It's really boring," Glen said. "You spend the whole time in bed."

61
00:04:14.566 --> 00:04:17.953
"Sounds great to me," Ivy thought.

62
00:04:17.954 --> 00:04:22.831
"No canoeing, no soccer, no sports at all!"

63
00:04:22.832 --> 00:04:25.233
"Yellow team!" Penelope said.

64
00:04:25.234 --> 00:04:30.769
"Pay attention, please. We have more strokes to learn."

65
00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:33.082
Ivy waved her paddle in the air.

66
00:04:33.083 --> 00:04:41.417
"Penelope? I'm not feeling well. I need to get back to shore."

67
00:04:41.418 --> 00:04:46.150
As the kids paddled back, Ezra asked Ivy what was wrong.

68
00:04:46.151 --> 00:04:50.304
Ivy chuckled. "Nothing's wrong.

69
00:04:50.305 --> 00:04:55.043
In fact, everything's about to get much better!"

70
00:04:55.044 --> 00:05:00.747
When they reached shore, Ivy stepped out and took a few wobbly steps.

71
00:05:00.748 --> 00:05:10.930
Then she closed her eyes and pretended to faint.

